    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages persistent workspace state with durability and corruption recovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Responsibilities:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Load state.json with checksum validation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Save state atomically (write temp file, rename on success)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Detect and recover from corruption</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Maintain append-only transaction log for recovery</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safety: Methods are NOT thread-safe by default. Caller must serialize access via external mutex if needed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
